OL,3,AMeta to pay up to $18bn to settle
OL,4,Aclaims its platforms harm children
OL,5,
OL,6,FSocial media giant Meta has agreed to a
OL,7,F$18bn (#13.3bn) settlement with US
OL,8,Fstates and territories to resolve
OL,9,Fclaims that Facebook and Instagram
OL,10,Fharmed children.
OL,12,FA California judge approved the
OL,13,Fsettlement, which Meta must pay to 48
OL,14,Fstates, plus the District of Columbia
OL,15,Fand three US territories, marking the
OL,16,Fcompany's largest payment over child
OL,17,Fsafety litigation to date.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
