OL,3,ASusan Sarandon leads tributes to Rocky
OL,4,AHorror Picture Show co-star Tim Curry
OL,5,
OL,6,FStars of stage and screen have paid
OL,7,Ftribute to cult British actor Tim
OL,8,FCurry, who has died at the age of 80.
OL,10,F"What I loved about him most was his
OL,11,Fheart," said Oscar-winner Susan
OL,12,FSarandon, who co-starred with him in
OL,13,FThe Rocky Horror Picture Show.
OL,15,FCurry, who was born in the
OL,16,Fnorth-western English town of
OL,17,FWarrington in 1946, passed away
OL,18,Fpeacefully at his home in Los Angeles
OL,19,Fon Tuesday, said his manager. He had
OL,20,Fused a wheelchair since suffering a
OL,21,Fmajor stroke in 2012.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
