OL,3,A'Angel by my side' - Miley Cyrus pays
OL,4,Atribute to godmother Dolly Parton
OL,5,
OL,6,FMiley Cyrus, Taylor Swift, Beyonce and
OL,7,FSir Paul McCartney have led an
OL,8,Foutpouring of tributes from celebrities
OL,9,Fand fans to Dolly Parton following the
OL,10,Fmusic icon's death at the age of 80.
OL,12,FCyrus paid an emotional tribute to her
OL,13,Fgodmother, "Aunt Dolly", describing her
OL,14,Fas an "angel by my side". She wrote on
OL,15,FInstagram: "I will always love her and
OL,16,Fwant to make her proud."
OL,18,FThe Tennessee-born singer died on
OL,19,FTuesday after "a brief battle with
OL,20,Fcancer", her team said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/19
